  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "In a pan, mix Carnaroli Rice with Bhuna Spices Mix and salt. Sauté until fragrant and the rice becomes translucent.",
    "Stir in milk and continue cooking for another minute. Remove from heat and let it cool slightly.",
    "Beat eggs with sugar until fluffy. Add cooled Carnaroli-Rice mixture and baking powder, stirring well to combine evenly.",
    "Transfer batter into a greased 8-inch square cake pan or individual ramekins. Bake for 20-25 minutes or until golden brown on top.",
    "Cool slightly before serving."
